 - Copy-furigana,Duality,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,8,502,0,130,1Style: Translation - Copy - Copy-furigana,Duality,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,2,545,0,10,1Style: Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: Translation-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Default-furigana,Arial,10,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1,1,2,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,70,&H009E375F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Translation,Duality,70,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: CaptionsBig,Roboto,40,&H00000000,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,10,10,11,1Style: Translation Gray,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00807C7A,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke Gray-furigana,Duality,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji Gray-furigana,Duality,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00807C7A,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,8,10,10,120,1Style: Kanji Gray,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00807C7A,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: Karaoke Gray,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00807C7A,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke - Copy - Copy,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,373,0,10,1Style: Kanji - Copy - Copy,Duality,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00E4BA0F,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,350,0,110,1Style: OP13-Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1Style: Pekoms - Infobox,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Map,Roboto,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1Style: Lyrics Post-War,FOT-Greco Std B,39,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.6,0,2,10,10,15,1Style: Captions Wano,Dry Brush,45,&H0038342E,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H0038342E,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0.2,0,1,2,0,2,10,10,10,0[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.41,0:00:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin is steadily approaching the Gates of Justice...Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,while we're here fighting like this.Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:18.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should say that from her perspective, she's approaching hell?Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know. Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.23,0:00:22.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It's true. Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Robin-chan's life is at stake!Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.97,0:00:26.22,Main,,0,0,0,,But if you get in my way, Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.22,0:00:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't go easy on you just because you're a woman! Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hand over that key before you get hurt! Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Raising your voice won't yield the key. Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.61,0:00:41.89,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to treat me like a woman. Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:45.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't live in such a delicate world.Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.93,0:00:48.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Since we've got an extermination order, Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:51.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll just take your life, that's all.Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't have it. Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:03.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I just want... Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.30,0:01:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,the key to Robin-chan's handcuffs. Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Then I guess teatime is over?Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.65,0:01:10.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:19.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Your power is indeed that of a superhuman.Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.84,0:01:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,An opening!Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:35.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I landed a blow.Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:48.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! How could you?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:52.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you call “landing a blow”?Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you...? You little...Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's fast! Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.52,0:02:27.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I've just stomped you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.11,Main,,0,0,0,,That means you lost!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.11,0:02:31.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, give me the key... Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:37.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What a disappointing man. Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a pirate, Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.27,0:02:50.30,Main,,0,0,0,,and yet, you're quite the coward! Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:52.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.98,0:02:54.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me the key!Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:03:00.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your transparent threats.Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Shall we try something fun? Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You're dead unless you fight back. Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:05.65,Title,,0,0,250,,Mr. ChivalryDialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:08.91,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's not coming after me. Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:12.75,Captions,,860,0,365,,First Floor - Receiving Area Nami vs. KumadoriDialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:15.00,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Good!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:19.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If I'd have been caught again, I'd be dead.Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:21.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll just run and...Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Life Return!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:29.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:31.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.51,0:05:36.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, shall I...Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,pierce you to death... Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:42.69,Main,,0,0,0,,or choke you to death?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:46.77,Main,,0,0,0,,A wintry blast blows through this world. Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:52.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Your peaceful rest comes before the first buds of spring. Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:59.15,Main,,0,0,0,,At least once more, Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:03.56,Main,,0,0,0,,you shall bloom lovely scarlet petals... Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,before you fall!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.44,0:06:10.37,Main,,0,0,0,,My duty is to offer such compassion!Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,When you arrive in the afterlife,Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,please tell my late mother...Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:28.36,Main,,0,0,0,,that I'm... I'm doing fine... Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:31.49,Main,,0,0,0,,as an assassin! Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, die!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Now... Now... Now!Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:38.87,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Song of Spring Spirit! Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:47.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Cloven Roseo! Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:00.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami! Are you okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.01,0:07:05.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper, Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:07.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks. You saved me.Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:08.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that guy?Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:11.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Does he have a devil fruit power? Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:12.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know.Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,His hair moves like an octopus, so I couldn't do anything. Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.05,0:07:19.57,Main,,0,0,0,,More importantly, now is our chance, Chopper.Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.57,0:07:21.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here right away.Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.59,0:07:24.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Unless we defeat him, we can't get the key.Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:25.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean this, right?Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:33.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I stole the key without him noticing, but I just couldn't get away from him.Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.58,0:07:35.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know what's going on with the others?Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, Nami.Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What number does it have on it?Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:39.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Number?Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It says 3.Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:41.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Wrong one.Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this number?Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.45,0:07:49.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Something fell down!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it... a doll?! Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:55.20,Main,,0,0,0,,No. Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:57.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Why does he look like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:02.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:03.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Why is your body like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sanji-kun?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:13.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I lost. Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:23.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't get the key.Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.84,0:08:27.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, Sanji. I'll give you first aid.Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.78,0:08:31.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I never thought that Sanji-kun would lose. Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:42.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun, Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:45.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Were you really not able to defeat her?Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you give her an honest fight? Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It was that woman who you fought, wasn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:53.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You're soft with women.Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about the key.Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:58.53,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not it!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:00.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that because of that stupid chivalry,Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,you could die! Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:06.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You're gonna stick to it even after getting hurt like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:07.94,Main,,0,0,0,,What would we do without you?! Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.53,0:09:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like...Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:12.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to die.Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just that, Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I was raised with the idea that kicking women is wrong beaten into me. Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:19.78,Main,,0,0,0,,So, Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,even at the cost of my life, Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.69,0:09:25.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't kick a woman! Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You're an idiot. Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:32.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Stupid! Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.06,0:09:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you doing, Nami?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.54,0:09:38.24,Main,,0,0,0,,If running away also violates your code of chivalry,Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:40.64,Main,,0,0,0,,at least ditch that part of it! Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not worth dying in vain. Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:47.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave that woman to me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:50.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Also,Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:53.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I think a little more of your code of chivalry than I did before. Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.90,0:09:54.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.81,0:09:57.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Did she just say that she loves me more?Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.57,Main,,0,0,0,,No, she didn't!Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not kind.Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:09.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither am I.Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:12.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds like we can get along.Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:30.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.26,0:10:31.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The octopus guy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:32.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't...Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:38.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:39.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami, you go deal with that woman!Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:41.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do something about this guy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:44.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.01,0:10:49.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you getting in my way?! Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:50.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Cloven...Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Cross!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:06.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Pirate guy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:22.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously, there's no way you can cross water like this on a boat, now is there?Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:28.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But Robin was taken to those gates!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.67,0:11:33.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Unless I hurry up, I won't be able to bring her back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:36.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, pirate guy!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:44.16,Main,,0,0,0,,We came to tell you how to get to the Gates of Justice!Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.16,0:11:44.85,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:49.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, you're amazing. Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that you knew about a passage like this!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.31,0:11:57.32,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw Lucci's lackey going down the stairs, laughing very loudly. Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.45,Main,,0,0,0,,So I followed them.Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:06.66,Note,,0,0,30,,Box reads “The Lackey” Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:05.30,Main,,0,0,0,,If they don't know where the entrance is, they can't come after us!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:06.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Serves them right!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucci and that black-haired lady went through the doors, too.Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.39,Main,,0,0,0,,So these are them, huh? Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,They're really heavy-duty iron doors. Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know how to open them?Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:39.09,Main,,0,0,0,,The lackey was doing something over here, Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:42.19,Main,,0,0,0,,so I bet you can control them with this keyhole! Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have the key, though. Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:53.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys, step back. Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:56.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:01.34,Main,,0,0,0,,We can go to the Gates of Justice through here, right?Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Er... Yeah. Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Third!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:40.54,Main,,0,0,0,,They opened! Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:42.25,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! I'm heading there now!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.01,0:13:45.72,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! How come you're small now?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.66,0:14:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That pirate guy sure is interesting!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I just heard a loud noise.Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:07.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Was that my imagination?Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it couldn't have been.Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:13.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Could that noise have been one of the pirates destroying the doors?Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:15.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Such a ridiculous idea isn't possible! Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:18.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are thick iron doors!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, there's no way that they could find those doors!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, they should know where they are, since a child and her pet were following us.Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:28.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:31.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I-If you knew that, why didn't you kill them?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.04,0:14:34.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Because...Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I received no such order. Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! You dimwit! Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,For something so trivial, use your own discretion!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:44.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you imagine what'd happen if you didn't do anything about it?! Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.73,0:14:46.32,Main,,0,0,0,,So what're you saying?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:48.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that someone's headed this way?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.31,0:14:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Back to normal! Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.11,0:15:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Just wait, Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:10.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be sure to beat the crap out of that pigeon guy!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:16.60,Captions,,0,900,360,,Pantry Front Passage Franky vs. FukuroDialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:15.86,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I need to refill my cola as soon as possible. Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:21.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,For someone with such a large body, he sure does like to bounce around. Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:27.57,Main,,0,0,0,, I'm right here.Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.91,0:15:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like you're at least quick when it comes to escaping.Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:38.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm under no obligation to take the punches you're so proud of. Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky Triangle Jacker!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd get hit by sideburns like that! Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got you!Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:57.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like I'm almost out of cola.Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:06.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd better get to the kitchen now! Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.99,0:16:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.78,0:16:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! He dodged my attack!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn wimp, you're an expert at running away!Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.83,0:16:15.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:16.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.87,0:16:20.95,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, wimp?Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:22.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not running away this time?Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.40,0:16:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You made me mad with what you said! Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:31.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Take my killer fist!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:35.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a super heavy punch combined with Finger Pistol's speed!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Tough Dugong! Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:42.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,What a puny, ineffective punch! Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:49.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Strong...Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:50.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:52.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Hammer!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:00.99,Main,,0,0,0,,That was a pathetic punch.Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.99,0:17:02.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Tough Dugong! Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:21.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Your punches are flabby.Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.91,0:17:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,No.Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:26.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Your punches are limp.Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.99,0:17:29.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, your punches are flimsy.Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:33.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Your underpants are lazy.Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Underpants?Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:37.90,Main,,0,0,0,,They're not punches!Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Underpants! That's what you are!Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You damn bra! Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.90,0:17:43.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, socks!Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:44.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Long johns!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:45.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Loose shorts!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:46.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Loincloth!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:48.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:17:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:00.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, coin purse! Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Great! Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I made it into the kitchen! Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:08.62,Main,,0,0,0,,There it is! A huge refrigerator!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:15.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that him?Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:17.49,Main,,0,0,0,,He probably has a gorilla-type devil fruit power. Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.27,0:18:21.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Three minutes have already passed?Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:25.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I used the rumble ball too soon.Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:35.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Depart the three planes of existence! Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:38.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Your life ends here! Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:39.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:42.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Good! It's got a lock!Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,, Kumadori!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! I locked him in!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:52.92,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you?! Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on a sec, gorilla!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:56.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I need that fridge!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:59.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! CP9 and the punk!Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:01.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Franky! I'm on your side, remember?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:02.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Who'd you call a gorilla?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.99,0:19:03.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You're too slow!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.49,0:19:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen.Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.48,0:19:09.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Just like Luffy, I haven't forgiven you yet.Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,The reason Usopp left us was...Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.17,0:19:15.43,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all your fault! Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:17.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Give us Usopp back!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you guys were with him earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not important right now!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:24.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna save Nico Robin?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:27.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I do! Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.60,0:19:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Then get three bottles of cola from that fridge and give them to me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:33.97,Main,,0,0,0,,With cola, I can power up!Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:38.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of these guys in an instant and take their keys!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of idiot actually gets stronger with cola?Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:42.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! That'd be me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Just how long...Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:49.53,Main,,0,0,0,,are you planning to keep up the comedy act?! Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you're trying to have a tea break during a fight? Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:54.80,Main,,0,0,0,,How rude!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Tough Dugong Esoterica: Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:01.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Owl Thrashing!Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Beans Left!Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:19.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.11,0:20:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahh! This is terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.45,0:20:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! He's on our side right now!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:27.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do what he told me to.Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:33.81,Main,,0,0,0,,If I open the door and close it in less than a second, he can't come out! Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:42.17,Main,,0,0,0,,The door has...Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:47.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver! Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.81,0:20:58.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Fresh!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:02.24,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...?Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.71,0:21:08.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Freshness is most important! Vegetable Punch! Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:09.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Tough Dugong.Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! That was vegetable juice!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's prioritizing health around here, you bastard?! Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:19.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Give me cola!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:21.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it wasn't because he was thirsty.Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.76,Main,,0,0,0,, The door...Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:26.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Here you go!Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:28.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.01,0:21:34.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling good!Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.56,0:21:37.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Well,Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.94,0:21:39.69,Main,,0,0,0,,let me take a rest. Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.98,Main,,0,0,0,,My work in the field is done for now.Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:44.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop being so upset.Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:46.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't fight.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.36,0:21:48.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have some tea?Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:49.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Tea wouldn't...Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:53.45,Main,,0,0,0,,give me energy! You moron! Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:21:56.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He's... funny.Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:22:02.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with that “I wonder what happens with other drinks” look?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.17,0:22:05.45,Main,,0,0,0,,This'll be the last time, you damn deer!Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.45,0:22:07.55,Main,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't depend on how you're feeling?Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.55,0:22:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I need only cola!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:13.81,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it! Without a doubt! Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.18,0:22:15.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:22.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the deal is, but I'm not gonna let you have your way!Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:23.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.11,0:22:26.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:40.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:07.36,Main,,0,0,0,, What's the deal?Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.36,0:23:09.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not like drinking cola would make a difference or anything.Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.95,0:23:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Put up your guard. Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.73,0:23:16.89,Main,,0,0,0,, What a fool.Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.89,0:23:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna give me another pathetic punch?Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.41,0:23:23.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Strong... Hammer!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.19,0:23:44.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoooa! Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.05,0:24:05.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.02,0:24:09.07,Main,,0,0,0,,My punches earlier were...Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.07,0:24:11.55,Main,,0,0,0,,indeed pathetic. Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.55,0:24:14.60,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Control: danpmss, DolphinWeabu, Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Honoka, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, Gaijin Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.64,0:03:12.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:03:11.67,0:03:12.48,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:03:12.48,0:03:12.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:03:12.48,0:03:12.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:03:12.48,0:03:12.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:03:12.48,0:03:12.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:03:12.48,0:03:12.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:03:11.71,0:03:12.59,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:03:11.74,0:03:12.59,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:03:11.78,0:03:12.59,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:03:11.81,0:03:13.07,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:03:11.85,0:03:13.07,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:03:13.07,0:03:13.53,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:03:13.07,0:03:13.53,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:03:13.07,0:03:13.53,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:03:13.07,0:03:13.53,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialog